#: ../../changelog/firmware/v2.4.0.rst:4
msgid "v2.4.0"
msgstr "v2.4.0"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v2.4.0.rst:6
msgid ""
"v2.4.0 rewrites ``find_lines()`` as a Hough-transform detector, adds "
"``find_line_segments()``, ``find_datamatrices()`` data-matrix decoding, "
"``sensor.set_vsync_output()``, image-slice read/write, and many new scaled "
"framesizes for higher FPS. ``find_lines()``, ``match_descriptor()``, and "
"``skip_frames()`` changed — read the breaking changes below."
msgstr ""
"v2.4.0 将 ``find_lines()`` 重写为霍夫变换检测器，新增了 ``find_line_segments()``\\ 、\\ "
"``find_datamatrices()`` 数据矩阵解码、\\ ``sensor.set_vsync_output()``\\ "
"、图像切片读写，以及许多新的缩放分辨率以获得更高的帧率。\\ ``find_lines()``\\ 、\\ ``match_descriptor()``"
" 和 ``skip_frames()`` 发生了变化 —— 请阅读下方的破坏性变更。"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v2.4.0.rst:15
msgid "On this page"
msgstr "本页内容"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v2.4.0.rst:18
msgid "Highlights"
msgstr "亮点"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v2.4.0.rst:20
msgid ""
"``find_lines()`` — rewritten as a Hough-transform line detector returning "
"line objects (now works on RGB565, not just grayscale)."
msgstr "``find_lines()`` —— 重写为霍夫变换直线检测器，返回直线对象（现在可用于 RGB565，而不仅仅是灰度图像）。"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v2.4.0.rst:22
msgid "``find_line_segments()`` — detect finite line segments."
msgstr "``find_line_segments()`` —— 检测有限长度的线段。"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v2.4.0.rst:23
msgid "``find_datamatrices()`` — data-matrix decoding."
msgstr "``find_datamatrices()`` —— 数据矩阵解码。"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v2.4.0.rst:24
msgid ""
"``sensor.set_vsync_output()`` — drive VSYNC on an I/O pin for camera "
"synchronization."
msgstr "``sensor.set_vsync_output()`` —— 在 I/O 引脚上驱动 VSYNC 以实现摄像头同步。"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v2.4.0.rst:26
msgid ""
"**More framesizes** — many additional scaled resolutions for higher FPS."
msgstr "**更多分辨率** —— 许多额外的缩放分辨率，以获得更高的帧率。"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v2.4.0.rst:27
msgid ""
"**Breaking:** ``find_lines()``, ``match_descriptor()``, and "
"``skip_frames()`` changed — see the breaking changes."
msgstr ""
"**破坏性变更：** ``find_lines()``\\ 、\\ ``match_descriptor()`` 和 ``skip_frames()``"
" 发生了变化 —— 请参阅破坏性变更。"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v2.4.0.rst:31
msgid "New features"
msgstr "新功能"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v2.4.0.rst:33
msgid ""
"``image.find_line_segments()`` — find non-infinite line segments; line "
"objects gained a ``.length()`` accessor."
msgstr ""
"``image.find_line_segments()`` —— 查找非无限长的线段；直线对象新增了 ``.length()`` 访问器。"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v2.4.0.rst:35
msgid ""
"``image.find_datamatrices()`` — data-matrix decoding, with example scripts."
msgstr "``image.find_datamatrices()`` —— 数据矩阵解码，并附带示例脚本。"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v2.4.0.rst:37
msgid ""
"``sensor.set_vsync_output(pin)`` — output the VSYNC signal on a GPIO pin for"
" camera synchronization (OpenMV 2 / OpenMV 3)."
msgstr ""
"``sensor.set_vsync_output(pin)`` —— 在 GPIO 引脚上输出 VSYNC 信号以实现摄像头同步（OpenMV 2 /"
" OpenMV 3）。"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v2.4.0.rst:39
msgid ""
"**Image slices** — image subscript / buffer protocol now supports reading "
"and writing slices of the image data."
msgstr "**图像切片** —— 图像下标 / 缓冲区协议现在支持读取和写入图像数据的切片。"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v2.4.0.rst:41
msgid ""
"Added many additional scaled resolution / framesize combinations to support "
"higher frame rates; ``clock.fps()`` now resets its accumulators every 2 s so"
" the reported FPS tracks the recent rate."
msgstr ""
"新增了许多额外的缩放分辨率 / 帧大小组合以支持更高的帧率；\\ ``clock.fps()`` 现在每 2 秒重置一次其累加器，使报告的 FPS "
"能跟踪最近的速率。"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v2.4.0.rst:46
msgid "Other changes and improvements"
msgstr "其他变更与改进"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v2.4.0.rst:48
msgid ""
"The OV7725 is windowed to QVGA when the resolution is ≤ VGA (fewer dropped "
"frames at high capture rates) and its PLL was set to 6× with a reduced "
"external clock (OpenMV 2 48 MHz, OpenMV 3 54 MHz), altering sensor frame "
"timing."
msgstr ""
"当分辨率 ≤ VGA 时，OV7725 会被窗口化为 QVGA（在高采集速率下减少丢帧），其 PLL 被设置为 6×，并降低了外部时钟（OpenMV 2"
" 为 48 MHz，OpenMV 3 为 54 MHz），从而改变了传感器的帧时序。"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v2.4.0.rst:54
msgid "Bug fixes"
msgstr "缺陷修复"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v2.4.0.rst:56
msgid "Imaging:"
msgstr "成像："

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v2.4.0.rst:58
msgid ""
"Fixed the ``compress_for_ide()`` buffer-size error (start/end marker), QR "
"decoding (plus upstream quirc cell-bitmap indexing and alignment-pattern "
"bounds fixes)."
msgstr ""
"修复了 ``compress_for_ide()`` 缓冲区大小错误（起始/结束标记）、QR 解码（以及上游 quirc "
"单元位图索引和对齐图案边界修复）。"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v2.4.0.rst:62
msgid "Sensor and connectivity:"
msgstr "传感器与连接："

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v2.4.0.rst:64
msgid ""
"Lowered the OpenMV 2 sensor clock to work with the higher sensor PLL (camera"
" init/sync) and made WINC ``socket.recvfrom()`` return the actual received "
"size (erroring on a non-positive size instead of returning a stale value)."
msgstr ""
"降低了 OpenMV 2 传感器时钟以配合更高的传感器 PLL（摄像头初始化/同步），并使 WINC 的 ``socket.recvfrom()`` "
"返回实际接收到的大小（在大小为非正值时报错，而不是返回过时的值）。"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v2.4.0.rst:70
msgid "Hardware and board support"
msgstr "硬件与开发板支持"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v2.4.0.rst:72
msgid ""
"**VSYNC output** on a GPIO pin (OpenMV 2 / OpenMV 3) backing "
"``sensor.set_vsync_output()``."
msgstr ""
"支持 ``sensor.set_vsync_output()`` 的 GPIO 引脚 **VSYNC 输出**\\ （OpenMV 2 / OpenMV"
" 3）。"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v2.4.0.rst:74
msgid "**OpenMV 3** — enabled :class:`pyb.UART` UART1."
msgstr "**OpenMV 3** —— 启用了 :class:`pyb.UART` UART1。"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v2.4.0.rst:77
msgid "Breaking API changes"
msgstr "破坏性 API 变更"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v2.4.0.rst:79
msgid ""
"User-visible API breaks between v2.3.0 and v2.4.0. Scope: Python C-modules "
"in ``modules/`` and Python libraries in ``scripts/libraries/``."
msgstr ""
"v2.3.0 与 v2.4.0 之间面向用户的 API 破坏性变更。范围：\\ ``modules/`` 中的 Python C 模块和 "
"``scripts/libraries/`` 中的 Python 库。"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v2.4.0.rst:82
msgid "Each change is tagged with its impact:"
msgstr "每项变更都标注了其影响："

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v2.4.0.rst:84
msgid ""
"*major* — affects most scripts that used the feature; you will need to port "
"code."
msgstr "*major* —— 影响大多数使用该功能的脚本；你需要移植代码。"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v2.4.0.rst:86
msgid "*minor* — narrow API; only affects scripts that used it."
msgstr "*minor* —— 范围较窄的 API；仅影响使用了它的脚本。"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v2.4.0.rst:87
msgid "*behavior* — same API, different results; re-check tuned scripts."
msgstr "*behavior* —— API 相同，但结果不同；请重新检查经过调优的脚本。"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v2.4.0.rst:89
msgid ""
"Changes are grouped by impact in that order. If you just want to port your "
"code, jump to the :ref:`migration checklist <v2_4_0_migration>` at the end. "
"Each commit hash links to its diff on GitHub."
msgstr ""
"变更按影响程度依此顺序分组。如果你只想移植代码，可直接跳到末尾的 :ref:`迁移清单 <v2_4_0_migration>`\\ "
"。每个提交哈希都链接到其在 GitHub 上的差异。"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v2.4.0.rst:96
msgid "``find_lines()`` rewritten as a Hough detector *(major)*"
msgstr "``find_lines()`` 重写为霍夫检测器 *(major)*"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v2.4.0.rst:98
msgid ""
"``image.find_lines()`` was rewritten as a Hough-transform detector. It no "
"longer returns a list of ``(x1, y1, x2, y2)`` tuples — it returns line "
"objects (``.line()`` / ``.x1()`` / ``.y1()`` / ``.x2()`` / ``.y2()`` / "
"``.theta()`` / ``.rho()`` / ``.magnitude()``) — and now also works on RGB565"
" (not just grayscale). The ``threshold`` argument changed from a 0.0–1.0 "
"float to an integer edge-magnitude sum, ``line.magnitude`` is now an "
"integer, and new ``theta_margin`` / ``rho_margin`` keywords were added. Port"
" tuple-unpacking code to the line objects and re-tune ``threshold``."
msgstr ""
"``image.find_lines()`` 被重写为霍夫变换检测器。它不再返回 ``(x1, y1, x2, y2)`` 元组的列表 —— "
"而是返回直线对象（\\ ``.line()`` / ``.x1()`` / ``.y1()`` / ``.x2()`` / ``.y2()`` / "
"``.theta()`` / ``.rho()`` / ``.magnitude()``\\ ）—— 并且现在也可用于 "
"RGB565（而不仅仅是灰度图像）。\\ ``threshold`` 参数从 0.0–1.0 的浮点数改为整数边缘幅值总和，\\ "
"``line.magnitude`` 现在是整数，并新增了 ``theta_margin`` / ``rho_margin`` "
"关键字。请将元组解包代码移植到直线对象上，并重新调优 ``threshold``\\ 。"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v2.4.0.rst:107
msgid ""
"*Commits:* `31b7b5bf3 "
"<https://github.com/openmv/openmv/commit/31b7b5bf3>`__, `f4a9c6154 "
"<https://github.com/openmv/openmv/commit/f4a9c6154>`__"
msgstr ""
"*提交：* `31b7b5bf3 <https://github.com/openmv/openmv/commit/31b7b5bf3>`__\\ "
"、\\ `f4a9c6154 <https://github.com/openmv/openmv/commit/f4a9c6154>`__"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v2.4.0.rst:113
msgid "``match_descriptor()`` returns a match object *(minor)*"
msgstr "``match_descriptor()`` 返回一个匹配对象 *(minor)*"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v2.4.0.rst:115
msgid ""
":func:`image.match_descriptor` (ORB) now returns a ``kptmatch`` object with "
"``.cx()`` / ``.cy()`` / ``.x()`` / ``.y()`` / ``.w()`` / ``.h()`` / "
"``.count()`` / ``.theta()`` / ``.rect()`` accessors instead of a plain "
"8-tuple. The object is still subscriptable/sliceable so positional indexing "
"keeps working, but code that did ``isinstance(result, tuple)`` (or used "
"tuple methods) must use the new accessors."
msgstr ""
":func:`image.match_descriptor`\\ （ORB）现在返回一个 ``kptmatch`` 对象，带有 ``.cx()`` / "
"``.cy()`` / ``.x()`` / ``.y()`` / ``.w()`` / ``.h()`` / ``.count()`` / "
"``.theta()`` / ``.rect()`` 访问器，而不是一个普通的 8 元组。该对象仍可下标访问/切片，因此按位置索引仍然有效，但使用 "
"``isinstance(result, tuple)``\\ （或使用元组方法）的代码必须改用新的访问器。"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v2.4.0.rst:122
msgid ""
"*Commits:* `e960546b6 <https://github.com/openmv/openmv/commit/e960546b6>`__"
msgstr ""
"*提交：* `e960546b6 <https://github.com/openmv/openmv/commit/e960546b6>`__"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v2.4.0.rst:127
msgid ":func:`sensor.skip_frames` is now time-based *(behavior)*"
msgstr ":func:`sensor.skip_frames` 现在基于时间 *(behavior)*"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v2.4.0.rst:129
msgid ""
":func:`sensor.skip_frames` was reworked to accept a ``time=`` keyword "
"(default ~300 ms) and is now time-based by default rather than running a "
"fixed frame count, stopping early once the time elapses. Scripts that relied"
" on an exact frame count should pass an explicit count and/or set ``time=`` "
"accordingly."
msgstr ""
":func:`sensor.skip_frames` 经过重新设计，现在接受一个 ``time=`` 关键字（默认约 300 "
"ms），并且默认基于时间而非运行固定的帧数，一旦时间耗尽即提前停止。依赖精确帧数的脚本应传入明确的帧数和/或相应地设置 ``time=``\\ 。"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v2.4.0.rst:135
msgid ""
"*Commits:* `a039b5d1c <https://github.com/openmv/openmv/commit/a039b5d1c>`__"
msgstr ""
"*提交：* `a039b5d1c <https://github.com/openmv/openmv/commit/a039b5d1c>`__"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v2.4.0.rst:140
msgid "Migration checklist"
msgstr "迁移清单"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v2.4.0.rst:142
msgid "For a clean port to v2.4.0 the typical work is:"
msgstr "要顺利移植到 v2.4.0，通常需要完成以下工作："

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v2.4.0.rst:144
msgid ""
"Port ``find_lines()`` tuple unpacking to the line objects and re-tune the "
"integer ``threshold`` (:ref:`the find_lines rewrite <v2_4_0_findlines>`)."
msgstr ""
"将 ``find_lines()`` 的元组解包移植到直线对象上，并重新调优整数 ``threshold``\\ （\\ "
":ref:`find_lines 重写 <v2_4_0_findlines>`\\ ）。"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v2.4.0.rst:146
msgid ""
"Use the ``kptmatch`` accessors instead of treating ``match_descriptor()`` "
"results as a tuple (:ref:`the match_descriptor change "
"<v2_4_0_matchdescriptor>`)."
msgstr ""
"使用 ``kptmatch`` 访问器，而不是将 ``match_descriptor()`` 的结果当作元组处理（\\ "
":ref:`match_descriptor 变更 <v2_4_0_matchdescriptor>`\\ ）。"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v2.4.0.rst:149
msgid ""
"Pass an explicit count and/or ``time=`` to :func:`sensor.skip_frames` if you"
" relied on a fixed frame count (:ref:`the skip_frames change "
"<v2_4_0_skipframes>`)."
msgstr ""
"如果你依赖固定的帧数，请向 :func:`sensor.skip_frames` 传入明确的帧数和/或 ``time=``\\ （\\ "
":ref:`skip_frames 变更 <v2_4_0_skipframes>`\\ ）。"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v2.4.0.rst:153
msgid "All other scripts run unchanged."
msgstr "所有其他脚本无需修改即可运行。"
